    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Linyasio eliali khung'ombe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana OMWAMI yamusunjila Musa mbu Yinjila ewaFarao nomuboolela mbu Kano niko aka OMWAMI, Nyasaye wabaHeburania, asunga; mbu Lekhuula abandu banje batsie, mbu bakhalabanile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba noba noloba okhubalekhuula, noshibatinyakhwo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lola, omukhono kwOMWAMI kulayeekha khumirukochio echili mubwayilo, khutsifarasi, khutsisishili, khungamia, khung'ombe, nende khubiayo; lulabaho oluumbe olutinyu muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne OMWAMI alakabukhania hakari wemiruko chiaIsiraeli nende emiruko chiaMisiri; ne ebiabaana baIsiraeli shibiitsa okhufwakhwo kata shilala ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI nalaka eshise, nasunga mbu Mukamba OMWAMI alakhola likhuwa lino khushialo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa bwashia mukamba OMWAMI nakhola likhuwa elo, emiruko chiosi chiaMisiri nichifwa; habula khumiruko chiabaana baIsiraeli, shikwafwakhwo kata mulala tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farao narumana, ne njiechio, shikwaliho kata mulala kwonyene okwokhumiruko chiabaana baIsiraeli okwali nikufwile ta. Nebutswa omwoyo kwaFarao kwali omutinyu, kata shiyalekhuula abandu abo tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Linyasio liamabure",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana OMWAMI yasunjila Musa nende Haruni mbu Mufumbare omuyale kwomushisambilo, mana Musa akwohe mwikulu, imbeli waFarao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kulakwa olufu olunyushe khushialo shiosi shiaMisiri, nikwikhola khubandu nende khumiruko amabure akanyalukhanga, mushialo shiosi shiaMisiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho nibabukula omuyale okwomushisambilo, nibasinjila imbeli waFarao; Musa nakwoha mwikulu; nikuba amabure akanyalukhanga, khubandu nende khumiruko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abafumu bakhaywa okhusiniila imbeli waMusa khulwa amabure; shichila amabure ako kali khubafumu tsana, nende khubaMisiri bosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa OMWAMI yatinyia omwoyo kwaFarao, kata shiyabahulila ta; shinga OMWAMI olwa yali namubooleele Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Linyasio lieifula yamachina",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana OMWAMI namusunjila Musa mbu Huuna mumabwibwi, osinjile imbeli waFarao, nomusunjila mbu Kano niko aka OMWAMI, Nyasaye wabaHeburania, asunga; mbu Lekhuula abandu banje batsie, mbu bakhalahanile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba luno ndalaruma amanyasio kanje kosi khwiwe omwene, nende khubasumbabo, nende khubandubo; mbu mana omanye shinga olwa abulaho oufwanana ninasi mushialo shiosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khane bulaano ndakhabeele nimalile okhunyiila omukhono kwanje, nikhukhupa iwe halala nende abandubo noluumbe, nawe wakhabeele nomalile okhukhalachisibwa olkhurula mushialo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nebutswa toto mwene, likhuwa lino nilio elichila nikhusinjisiye, mbu ekhulolosilie obunyali bwanje, khandi mbu eliira lianje lif umenje mushialo shiosi pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe oshiichinganga nobeekalila abandu banje, mbu olobe okhubalekhuula? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola, mukamba khushise shinga shino ndalakwisia ifula yamachina amanji muno, eyirashiabaho muMisiri okhurula olwa shiakhupwa omuse okhuula olwa leelo ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano rumana wanguyilisie okhwinjisia emirukochio nende biosi ebia oli ninabio mubwayilo; okhuba buli muruko okwa nakunyoolwe nikuli mubwayilo, nikuraleerilwe hango ta, amachina ako kalakukhupa, nikufwa, kata omundu yesi ario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abaria likhuwa liOMWAMI mubasumba baFarao beelusia abasumba babwe nende emiruko chiabwe, nibeenjisia munzu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne abarapaara khwikhuwa liOMWAMI ta balekha abasumba babwe nende emiruko chiabwe mubwayilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana OMWAMI nasunjila Musa mbu Nyiila omukhonokwo ikulu, mbu ifula yamachina yibeho mushialo shiosi shiaMisiri, khubandu, nende khumiruko, nende khumiani chiosi echiomumikunda, mushialo shiosi shiaMisiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa nanyiira indabushiye mwikulu; OMWAMI naleera okhukukuma khwelikulu nende amachina, omulilo nakwo nikuruuma nikukwa khushialo, OMWAMI nakwisia ifula yamachina khushialo shiaMisiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho amachina nikabaho, nende omulilo nikulabushilanga hakari mumachina ako, amabii muno; eyifwana shinga eyo shiyalikhwol o muMisiri okhurula olwa shieekhola lihanga tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amachina ako nikakhupa mushialo shiosi shiaMisiri, biosi ebiali mubwayilo, kata abandu kata emiruko; amachina nikakhupa nende emiani chiosi echiomumikunda, nikafunaka emisaala chiosi echiomumikunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habula mushialo shiaGosheni shionyene, ewa abaana baIsiraeli bali. Amachina nikarabayo ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Farao yarumana nalanga Musa nende Haruni, nabasunjila mbu Kho luno enzonoonile; OMWAMI nomulunjishi, ne isie nende abandu banje khuli abamayaanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saaye OMWAMI; okhuba okhukukuma khuno nende amachina kano bihelile; mana ndalamulekhuula, oburachweya khandi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Musa namusunjila ari Nindakhamala okhurula mwitookho, ndalakaliShila OMWAMI amakhono; okhukukuma khwelikulu khulahwa, kata ifula yamachina shiyilabaho khandi ta; mbu mana omanye shinga eshialo olwa shili eshiOMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa iwe, nende abasumbabo, emanyile mbu shimulamuria OMWAMI Nyasaye kata bulaano ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ikitani nende ishayiri tsiarootswa; okhuba ishayiri yali niyili okuruli, ikitani nayo niyikanikha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habula ingano nende obule shibiarootswa ta; shichila biali nibishili imbale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Musa yarula mutookho ewaFarao, nakalishila OMWAMI amakhono; okhukukuma nende amachina nibihwa, ifula nayo niyirasundukha khushialo ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa Farao yalola shinga ifula nende amachina nende okhukukuma khwelikulu olwa biali nibihweele, yameeta okhwonoona khandi, niyoomia omwoyokwe, ye nende abasumbabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omwoyo kwaFarao kwatinya, kata shiyalekhuula abaana baIsiraeli mbu batsie ta; shinga OMWAMI olwa yali naboolile mumunwa kwaMusa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
